{
  "requirement": "The harness MUST expose:\n\n```text\nfinish_search({ search_id: UUID, used: Array<String> })\n    -> { search_id: UUID, finished: true }\n```\n\nThe arguments MUST contain exactly these fields.",
  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "The tests adequately cover `requirements.authoring.finish_search`. That requirement has three obligations: the tool exists with the stated signature, its arguments are exactly `search_id` and `used`, and it returns `{search_id, finished:true}`.\n\n- **Exposure and signature:** `src/authoring/tools.rs#mod[tests]/fn[finish_search_advertises_the_accounting_schema_and_selection_rule]` asserts the full `finish_search` parameter schema. That schema has `search_id` as a UUID-format string and `used` as an array of strings. Both fields are required and `additionalProperties` is false. `fn[dispatch_paged]` routes `finish_search` to `pages.finish_search`, and I treated that routing as a pass-through. The behavioral tests call that same method.\n- **Exactly these fields:** `src/authoring/searches.rs#mod[tests]/fn[invalid_completion_is_atomic_and_can_be_corrected]` rejects null, `[]` and `{}`, a missing `used`, a missing `search_id`, and an extra field. Each rejection asserts the \"exactly search_id and used\" error. It also rejects wrong types for `search_id` and `used`. After each rejection it asserts that the search is still outstanding and that nothing was recorded. It then confirms a correct call succeeds.\n- **Result shape:** `fn[delivered_searches_including_empty_results_need_explicit_completion]` asserts that the result equals `{\"search_id\": ..., \"finished\": true}` for each finished search. `fn[selected_dependencies_keep_the_delivered_hash_and_accumulate_without_reads]` asserts the same result and that there is no `text` field.\n\nOther behavior, such as dependency recording, deduplication, atomicity and the description text, belongs to the refining sub-requirements. Those carry their own `{test}` references and are not reassessed here. I found no gap.",
  "references": "fb30bb4d08c7c2e4bc72f39568c837260ff783f460dbaac22396bf020e8d6484",
